(7589159, 1223195, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, I see what happened here. It''s happened to me a few times. Walking into a tear in the fabric of space-time and catching parts of multiple dimensions in the image. It''s rare that both the subject and their other-dimension self are wearing the same color dress though. So kudos for that.</td>', 'Ohhh, I see what happened here. It''s happened to me a few times. Walking into a tear in the fabric of space-time and catching parts of multiple dimensions in the image. It''s rare that both the subject and their other-dimension self are wearing the same color dress though. So kudos for that.', '2018-08-04 03:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589160, 1223183, 28742, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see the triplets all go out shooting together. :)</td>', 'It''s good to see the triplets all go out shooting together. :)', '2018-08-04 03:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589161, 1223213, 28742, '<td valign="top">I could nitpick about technical issues, but am mesmerized by the scene, so I''ll just give you an 8, two thumbs up, and a toast. Cheers!</td>', 'I could nitpick about technical issues, but am mesmerized by the scene, so I''ll just give you an 8, two thumbs up, and a toast. Cheers!', '2018-08-04 03:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
